@WeatherApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5144

### Hent alle gemte målinger
GET {{WeatherApi_HostAddress}}/api/weather-records
Accept: application/json

### Hent målinger for én by
GET {{WeatherApi_HostAddress}}/api/weather-records?city=Aarhus
Accept: application/json

### Gem en måling (samme JSON som Arduinoen sender, se example-payload.json) - forventet 201
POST {{WeatherApi_HostAddress}}/api/weather-records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "api": "Open-Meteo",
  "city": "Aarhus",
  "temperature": 11.3,
  "temperatureUnit": "°C",
  "humidity": 87,
  "humidityUnit": "%",
  "windSpeed": 4.2,
  "windSpeedUnit": "m/s",
  "dataTime": "2026-10-21T14:00",
  "timezone": "Europe/Copenhagen"
}

### Ugyldig tidszone - forventet 400 "Ukendt timezone"
POST {{WeatherApi_HostAddress}}/api/weather-records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "api": "Open-Meteo",
  "city": "Aarhus",
  "temperature": 11.3,
  "temperatureUnit": "°C",
  "humidity": 87,
  "humidityUnit": "%",
  "windSpeed": 4.2,
  "windSpeedUnit": "m/s",
  "dataTime": "2026-10-21T14:00",
  "timezone": "Mars/Olympus"
}

### Manglende by - forventet 400
POST {{WeatherApi_HostAddress}}/api/weather-records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "api": "Open-Meteo",
  "temperature": 11.3,
  "temperatureUnit": "°C",
  "humidity": 87,
  "humidityUnit": "%",
  "windSpeed": 4.2,
  "windSpeedUnit": "m/s",
  "dataTime": "2026-10-21T14:00",
  "timezone": "Europe/Copenhagen"
}
